  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "The children are ready to order food and choose their meals. They point to pictures of a hamburger and a cheeseburger. One picture shows a Big Mac with an extra bun in the middle. Other pictures show a chicken burger and a fish burger. They choose a Happy Meal with chicken nuggets and a small serving of French fries. The fries are hot, and a golden hash brown looks crispy. For a drink, one child chooses milk and the other chooses orange juice. The adult chooses a cold soft drink with ice. The children also look at an apple pie and an ice cream cone. A sundae has sweet sauce on top. The adult is ready to receive the food from the cashier. Nearby, other customers carry trays away from the counter.",
    "textZh": "小朋友準備好點餐，選擇自己的餐點。他們指著漢堡和起司漢堡的圖片。一張圖片上有一個中間多一層麵包的大麥克。其他圖片上有雞肉漢堡和魚肉漢堡。他們選了一份有雞塊和小份薯條的快樂兒童餐。薯條是熱的，金黃色的薯餅看起來很酥脆。飲料方面，一位小朋友選牛奶，另一位選柳橙汁。大人選了一杯加冰的冰汽水。小朋友也看看蘋果派和蛋捲冰淇淋。聖代上面淋著甜甜的醬。大人準備從收銀員手中領取餐點。附近，其他顧客端著托盤離開櫃檯。",
